# CraftSpec Cursor Rules
- Strictly follow "The Floor" design rules: No transition: all, no animating width/height/top/left.
- No purple-to-blue gradients, no cards inside cards, no emoji icons.
- Never invent metrics, testimonials, or fake logos.
- Mobile touch targets must be at least 44x44px.
- Use tokens for colors and fonts. Every interactive element must have :focus-visible.
